    <description>A comprehensive .NET library for managing keyboard shortcuts and keybindings with multi-profile support, command registry, and persistent storage.</description>
    <releaseNotes>## v1.0.44 (patch)

Changes since v1.0.43:

- Bump Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection and Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions ([@dependabot[bot]](https://github.com/dependabot[bot]))
- Bump the system group with 1 update ([@dependabot[bot]](https://github.com/dependabot[bot]))
- Bump the ktsu group with 1 update ([@dependabot[bot]](https://github.com/dependabot[bot]))</releaseNotes>
